<title>USA: Mar/Apr Brent rallies, April dips in late US trade.</title>
<headline>Mar/Apr Brent rallies, April dips in late US trade.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The March/April Brent spread rallied while April Brent partials dipped in late U.S. trading on Friday, traders said.</p>
<p>March/April was done twice at plus 49 and once at plus 50 cents a barrel, down from a 37-42 cent range earlier in the day. A top trading house was the buyer in all three deals.</p>
<p>April Brent partials traded at $19.70 and $19.72 a barrel, down from $19.82 at the IPE close.</p>
<p>--Patricia Garip-Bertuol NY Energy Desk ((+1 212 859 1620))</p>
